    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31635" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκᾰτόμ-πεδος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽπούσ̓</span>
